{"root":{"data":{"id":"dlh5zd2tzig0","created":1789604873218,"text":"RTOS"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlh5zfsetxs0","created":1789604879119,"text":"1、任务状态调度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlh5zktvlzc0","created":1789604890091,"text":"Running（正在CPU上执行）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh5zuttzeg0","created":1789604911856,"text":"Ready（具备运行条件，等待CPU中）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh605u9z5c0","created":1789604935828,"text":"Blocked（等待事件、如延时）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh60pwkkcg0","created":1789604979502,"text":"Suspend（人为暂停，等待resume）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlh64l3h0sg0","created":1789605282492,"text":"2、同步机制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlh64thezeo0","created":1789605300750,"text":"临界区：保护极短代码，不能阻塞"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh659vga1k0","created":1789605336427,"text":"调度器锁：限制任务切换"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh665eunc80","created":1789605405080,"text":"二值信号量：事件通知，适合ISR唤醒任务"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh66hxpm600","created":1789605432342,"text":"计数信号量：记录重复事件或资源数量"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh66tfq7ls0","created":1789605457376,"text":"互斥锁：保护共享资源，支持优先级继承"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh67pv8kr40","created":1789605527971,"text":"优先级继承：解决优先级反转，防止低优先级任务持锁"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlh6gornruo0","created":1789606230855,"text":"3、RPmsg和Mailbox"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlh6gv5uqpc0","created":1789606244774,"text":"概述：Mailbox 是硬件底层中断通知；RPmsg 是上层消息协议，跑在【共享内存 + Mailbox 中断】之上"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh6hbgmyr40","created":1789606280255,"text":"MailBox","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlh6itxih3k0","created":1789606398821,"text":"Mailbox 是 SoC 内部的硬件外设（寄存器组），作用只做一件事：给另一个核发中断通知，不负责传大数据。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh6j71298o0","created":1789606427334,"text":"原理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlh6j8yi86w0","created":1789606431533,"text":"1、两个核各有一组 Mailbox 寄存器（SET/STATUS/CLEAR）\n2、CoreA 写 Mailbox 的 TRIG 寄存器 → 硬件直接产生 CoreB 的中断\n3、CoreB 进中断服务函数，读到标记，知道对方有消息来了\n4、中断里必须写 CLEAR 寄存器清除 pending 位，否则反复进中断"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlh6jrjjeds0","created":1789606471987,"text":"RPmsg"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlh6k1rftjk0","created":1789606494232,"text":"属于 OpenAMP 框架组件，基于 VirtIO/vring 环形缓冲区 + 共享内存 + Mailbox 中断实现标准化核间消息收发，Linux、Zephyr、FreeRTOS 都支持ST\n\n标准化消息框架（定义消息怎么放共享内存、怎么分通道、回调分发）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh6kp12gnc0","created":1789606544881,"text":"核心"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlh6kqi41ls0","created":1789606548089,"text":"1、vring（virtio 环形队列）：放在共享内存，分 TX 环、RX 环，存放消息描述符、buffer 指针，双向两个环形队列\n2、Endpoint（端点）：逻辑端口号（32bit 地址），类似 UDP 端口；同一个双核链路可以开多个 endpoint，不同业务分开（控制命令、音频数据、日志）\n3、Name Service（名称服务）：远端核可以注册名字，主核发现并建立通道\n4、Master/Remote：Master 一般是 Linux/A 核，初始化共享内存、资源表 rsc_table；Remote 是 M 核 / DSP 跑 FreeRTOS/Zephyr"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}